"Gorgon's gift passed to Alden Thorn through an arcane exchange of blood."
"It lives in the recipient's mind as a presence that stabilizes their existence."
"The System calls it a previously unencountered presence; stabilizing is also a System function."
"It senses wordchain and contract imbalance, called uneven, and nags until it is fixed."
"It lets its holder eat only what is offered or entrusted to them."
"It made Alden unusually resistant to chaos, double stabilized with the System."
"Alden tried passing it on by drinking Kibby's blood, and Gorgon felt it from Earth."
